      "before": "kpk1-l19-c3-e01",
      "title": {
        "en": "Przed, za, pod, nad, między"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "When they say where something is (*gdzie?*), five prepositions take the instrumental, the case of *z kim?*: *przed* (in front of: *przed domem*), *za* (behind: *za drzewem*), *pod* (under: *pod krzesłem*), *nad* (above: *nad stołem*) and *między* (between: *między oknem a drzwiami*). The endings are those after *z*: *-em* for most masculine and neuter nouns, *-ą* for feminine ones: *pod lampą*."
      },
      "table": {
        "title": {
          "en": "Przyimki + narzędnik"
        },
